d": "1759901891583835", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819934_1759901894917168_1755884751114998428_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HeQQvOUwdKIQ7kNvwH16TJs&_nc_oc=AdlW4jXP1eYmMTt07__S1OwLzUydKt17PpusqlqQvkPjDwGUoWDZxu0sHnIj-bUGpbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfumDyH75EOAxh_tJw7XoCbCiMPZ5yBTBc3ZySXAVwzwDw&oe=6999B485"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "691900473696934", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499326349_691900477030267_8034961341760562964_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_qQ2dh0OHOsQ7kNvwEI4DS1&_nc_oc=AdlWd59TJ9djMKcg4_U2VPZIv2pLaygmJhGTBQCwGU7QV5B8Tl5iIJcIlGJvo6SyuwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft2Ku59_mfc4qcsEmcOeZwzZic6Umn3Np7msrbQF0c-Yg&oe=6999C05D"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "701610639047065", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311591_701610642380398_6712854599056515091_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tZKZvn1r2KMQ7kNvwF3XQuB&_nc_oc=AdlFfaDYbzia9d4fJkYekjTtQfZn6oNvtmYBxpcFGOgW_LVLVf3lXJtYWJ81cHaeXWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs3y3te805S2i963w1hgXQgFg759W7cvNVn9Nf0Jl4U-A&oe=69999A52"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1448057773232210", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499318571_1448057776565543_7678358617141313131_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hC1F5XUuOFwQ7kNvwEYwFYJ&_nc_oc=Adk_P62u5Kpyy1zxLQ2oBZGjX-k_jQsJ9lxKwOMwWQDg1aZCI9jlVlWQ-cEBdztizWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsWH6ZGCMpm1Ur0fG49ufJKG_PAhdA1OdOnxTsY85aqcA&oe=6999AE5C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DF_MA_META_HEADER_COVERLAND_TRAILERCOVER.png", "id": "1646731639656721", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831792_1646731642990054_4019563495684792553_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MiJA8QlT8oUQ7kNvwEBKrI6&_nc_oc=AdnOBFK_rHpMqWJpdis9ZIarBycf6oJlBpgnVVczI3qhmwLFiaqx6L4tM-8OyoGhRSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsgla7v9blVqx0a3VswWjIUUt7JviY7yQ3cMf9MmQaVrw&oe=699994D7"}, "display_name": "Dragon Fist: VR Kung Fu", "keywords": ["fighting", "kungfu", "physics", "boxing", "simulator"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n{1194756028402406}\n# **The Legend Begins...**\nA ruthless master rises. Vengeful emperors scheme. Peasants sharpen their blades. They all have something to prove\u2014and only one path forward: **Kung Fu.**\n\n{1903052986827168}\n# **Step Into Your Own Kung Fu Movie**\nYou\u2019re not watching a Kung Fu movie\u2014you\u2019re in it. Dragon Fist delivers fast-paced melee combat powered by physics and real martial arts.\n\n{808577998151364}\n# **Hone in Your Skills**\nPractice strikes, blocks, dodges, and combos. There is an endless amount of combat to explore.\n\n{354077967776881}\n# **Play Your Way**\n- Campaign\n- Multiplayer (up to 8)\n- Co-op Campaign\n- Training\n- and More...\n\n=========================\n\n# New DLC: Midnight Alley\n\nTake the fight to the streets! Midnight Alley contains a new environment for single and multiplayer modes, and 3 new characters.\n\n- **New Environment - The Alley:** A narrow streetside area lit by lanterns, windows and the moon. Features breakable doors that allow you to enter side buildings.\n- **3 New Characters:** Play as The Landlady, The Centipede, and White Eagle, each with their own perks, weaknesses, and special moves.", "short_description": "Step into your own Kung Fu Movie! This first-person Kung Fu fighter with stylized graphics, physics-based combat, and multiplayer pays homage to the golden era of martial arts films. Play with up to 8 friends in multiplayer modes like Co-Op, PvP, Challenges, or take on an expansive singleplayer campaign.